  "$comment": "Axon OS design tokens: the single source for colours, spacing, radii, type, shadows, focus ring and motion. Edit this file, then run: python3 scripts/gen_tokens.py Font sizes are in pt so they follow GNOME's Large Text setting (px does not); at 96 dpi 1pt is 1.33px. Greys are true neutrals; the one accent (blue) is for focus, selection, the main action and AI data only. 'material' is the translucent Shell layer (dock, top bar, menus); apps stay opaque.",
